<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 01:55:04 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>OpenAI 表示，它解决了数学的一项重大挑战。但关于他们是如何做到的以及这对我们所有人意味着什么，存在一些令人不安的问题</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/08/openai-says-it-cracked-navier-stokes-math-grand-challenge-buckmaster-accusation-cheating-intimidation-tao-lament/</link><description>OpenAI 否认窃取了数学家的数据。但他的担忧与许多首席执行官对人工智能公司的担忧相呼应。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-115135450-e1788893955802.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 19:52:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/08/openai-says-it-cracked-navier-stokes-math-grand-challenge-buckmaster-accusation-cheating-intimidation-tao-lament/</guid></item><item><title>南瓜香料时代正在发生变化——即使还没有结束，麦当劳十年来首次取代了这种口味</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/08/pumpkin-spice-mcdonalds-millennials-gen-z-climate-change/</link><description>随着麦当劳转向焦糖苹果，南瓜香料正在失去其在秋季的垄断地位。这不是另一场 Z 世代与千禧一代的战争。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2240390302-e1788900457764.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 20:57:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/08/pumpkin-spice-mcdonalds-millennials-gen-z-climate-change/</guid></item><item><title>秘鲁的货币体系在委内瑞拉行不通</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/08/perus-monetary-system-would-not-work-in-venezuela/</link><description>当委内瑞拉国民议会讨论如何消除世界上最高的通货膨胀率时，两位经济学家认为效仿秘鲁将是一个错误。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2293241818-e1788902660695.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 21:27:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/08/perus-monetary-system-would-not-work-in-venezuela/</guid></item><item><title>亨特·拜登推出 $LAPTOP memecoin，承诺将保留 20% 给在总统代币上亏损的交易员，以此来嘲弄特朗普</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/08/hunter-biden-launches-laptop-memecoin-trolls-trump-by-promising-that-20-will-be-reserved-for-traders-who-lost-money-on-presidents-token/</link><description>这一消息很快在加密推特上引起了批评，用户对与 memecoin 相关的“地毯拉动”表示厌倦。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2155936346-e1788887274412.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 17:13:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/08/hunter-biden-launches-laptop-memecoin-trolls-trump-by-promising-that-20-will-be-reserved-for-traders-who-lost-money-on-presidents-token/</guid></item><item><title>小马智行首席执行官认为机器人出租车将在五年内普及：“技术问题几乎已经解决”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/08/pony-ai-ceo-robotaxis-five-years/</link><description>虽然 Waymo 在美国的机器人出租车领域占据主导地位，但像小马智行这样的中国机器人出租车公司几乎在其他地方都取得了进展。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2231462224-e1788882342932.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 16:16:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/08/pony-ai-ceo-robotaxis-five-years/</guid></item><item><title>加拿大如何决定伤害自己的经济，提高通货膨胀——大多数加拿大人都批准了，因为他们对特朗普非常愤怒</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/08/canada-retaliatory-tariffs-hurt-economy-inflation-trump-unpopularity/</link><description>牛津大学经济学家预测，加拿大总理马克·卡尼的报复性关税将减缓经济增长并提高消费者价格。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2281261951-e1788898316393.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 20:36:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/08/canada-retaliatory-tariffs-hurt-economy-inflation-trump-unpopularity/</guid></item><item><title>Gavekal 的 Louis-Vincent Gave 表示，当事情变得糟糕时，你会想去中国</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/08/investors-china-bonds-us-debt-geopolitics/</link><description>“当事情进展顺利时，你想在美国[投资]，但当情况不顺利时，你会想在中国投资10%。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/55515172409_5b7a817fa7_o.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 14:28:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/08/investors-china-bonds-us-debt-geopolitics/</guid></item><item><title>三星是可折叠手机之王，销量增长了 30%，其最新设备受到好评。当苹果加入后，它能保住王冠吗？</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/08/samsung-dave-das-interview-foldable-smartphones-30-percent-sales-growth-apple/</link><description>三星美国执行副总裁 Dave Das 在接受《财富》杂志独家采访时表示，可折叠手机的需求和升级周期与早期的智能手机类似。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2240187433-rotated-e1788826184263.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 13:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/08/samsung-dave-das-interview-foldable-smartphones-30-percent-sales-growth-apple/</guid></item><item><title>OpenAI 详细介绍了人工智能如何加速自身的工作——尽管其首席科学家指出了日益增长的危险，并表示他希望该行业放慢脚步</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/08/openai-rsi-progress-jakub-pachoki-warns-dangers-slowdown-safety-rules/</link><description>OpenAI 表示，人类研究人员每工作一天，人工智能就能产生相当于三天的研究成果。 OpenAI 首席科学家 Jakub Pachocki 表示，人工智能应该被视为“外星人的思维”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2292926310-e1788863440600.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 11:01:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/08/openai-rsi-progress-jakub-pachoki-warns-dangers-slowdown-safety-rules/</guid></item><item><title>“美国拥有力量”：特朗普在 9/11 四分之一世纪周年纪念日之前纪念受害者</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/08/trump-victims-911-quarter-century-history/</link><description>此次活动的亮点是从世贸中心南塔回收的一根重约 17,000 磅、长 21 英尺的钢梁。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26251547237445-e1788893655109.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 19:04:29 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/08/trump-victims-911-quarter-century-history/</guid></item></channel></rss>